  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8e59cfbf-c0a4-40a6-b13f-27e6ce03fa17-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 281px;\" /></p><p>Let a&nbsp;small elementary cylinder in the shell of thickness&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>d</mo><mi>r</mi></math>.</p><p>The resistance of a wire is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#961;</mi></math>&nbsp;is the resistivity of the material.</p><p>The resistance of small element<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>d</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#961;dr</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;r</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Integrating both sides,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;l</mi></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mi>dr</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfrac></math></p>",
